    "description": "Choose a single <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon\">Exotic Weapon</a> or weapon group with which you are proficient. You gain a +2 bonus on damage rolls with such weapons. If you select <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heavy_Weapons\" title=\"Heavy Weapons\">Heavy Weapons</a> as the weapon group this Talent applies to, you may also use the Talent with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle Weapon\">Vehicle Weapon</a> attacks.<br><br>You may select this Talent multiple times. Each time you select this Talent, it applies to a different <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon\">Exotic Weapon</a> or weapon group.",
